    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δῐόσ-κοροι</span></b>  (the 
			Att.
		 form, <i><span class="en">
			Phryn.
			212
		</span></i>), 
			Ion.
		 and later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόσ-κουροι</span></b> , οἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the sons of Zeus,</i> i. e. <i>the twins of
				Leda,</i> Castor and Polydeuces, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				33.1
			</span></i>, etc.: dual <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διοσκόρω, τώ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				285
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1069
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				465
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Amphis
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				846
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				21.253d
			</span></i>: sg. dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				120
			</span></i>, cf. Varro <i><span class="en">
				<u>LL</u>
				5.66
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόσκοροι</span> is required by
			metre in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1643
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				1239
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κούρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					293a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					796b
				</span></i>
			, cod. Laur. in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.75
			</span></i>: both forms in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.127
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			constellation named from them <i>the Twins,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωτίδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.440
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				410.17
			</span></i>.</div>
